    "notes": {
        "62f8017f-b34e-404f-8639-1f2d390fc7a7": {
            "x": 48,
            "y": 480,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe trigger watches **Case.Status** with **Changes to = Closed**, which reads the Case Field History. **Field History Tracking must be on for Case Status** in the test org (Setup > Object Manager > Case > Fields & Relationships > Set History Tracking > Status). Without it the flow fails at start with a clear error.\n\nThe flow creates a Case (Status New), closes it and deletes it after the trigger fired. The trigger reads changes older than 30 seconds and polls every minute, so it fires 1-2 minutes after the update; AfterAll waits up to 10 minutes."
        }
    },
